---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "~/components/PageHeader.astro";
import Section from "~/components/Section.astro";
import { PHONE_DISPLAY, TEL_HREF, LEGAL_NAME, SITE_URL } from "~/lib/site-meta";

const updated = "September 2026";
---

<Layout
 title="Privacy Policy | Faith Lawn Care"
 description="How Faith Lawn Care handles the information you send through this website: what we collect, what we do with it, and why nothing is stored on the site."
 path="/privacy"
>
 <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy">
 Short version: we use what you send us to get back to you about your job,
 and nothing else.
 </PageHeader>

 <Section>
 <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
 <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft/70">Last updated: {updated}</p>

 <div>
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl text-ink">
 What we collect
 </h2>
 <p>
 If you fill in the estimate form, we collect the name, phone number,
 town, and any details you type — plus your email address if you choose
 to give one. That is the whole list. We do not ask for payment details
 on this website.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl text-ink">
 What we do with it
 </h2>
 <p>
 Form submissions are emailed straight to us so we can reply to your
 request. <strong class="text-ink">
 They are not saved to a database on this website
 </strong> — there is no customer account, no stored lead list, and no
 marketing list to be added to. Once your request is in our inbox, it is
 handled like any other message from a customer.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl text-ink">
 Who else is involved
 </h2>
 <p>
 This site is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, and the form is protected by
 Cloudflare Turnstile, which checks that a submission comes from a
 person rather than a bot. The email itself is delivered by Resend. Analytics are provided by Google. Each of these
          providers processes only what its own job requires. We do not sell, rent, or share your information with anyone else.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl text-ink">
 Cookies and tracking
 </h2>
 <p>
 This website uses Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages
          people actually read. It sets cookies in your browser and records
          things like the pages you view, roughly where you are, and what kind
          of device you used. We use it to understand what is useful on the
          site — not to identify you personally, and we do not sell or share
          it. Cloudflare may also set a strictly necessary cookie as part of
          the Turnstile bot check and its security protection.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl text-ink">
 Getting your information removed
 </h2>
 <p>
 No form submission is stored on this website, so removing what you
          sent us means deleting that email. Analytics data is held by Google
          and can be blocked at your end with any browser setting or extension
          that turns off analytics. Call or text
 <a href={TEL_HREF} class="font-semibold text-grass hover:underline">
 {PHONE_DISPLAY}
 </a> and ask, and we will delete it.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div>
 <h2 class="mb-3 font-display text-2xl text-ink">
 Contact
 </h2>
 <p>
 Questions about any of this go to {LEGAL_NAME} at
 <a href={TEL_HREF} class="font-semibold text-grass hover:underline">
 {PHONE_DISPLAY}
 </a>. This policy covers {SITE_URL} only.
 </p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </Section>
</Layout>
